#: 95815fbc9a6344c7a6a088b5964d3a97
msgid "Best Practices"
msgstr "最佳实践"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/6-submodules_visibility.md:150
#: d11578399aa24651b3b63bd234a28b76
msgid "**Use init scripts** — They respect visibility configuration"
msgstr "**使用初始化脚本** — 它们会遵守可见性配置"

