#: a5be6b735a3a4645bf9f7251ae2d5c00
msgid ""
"**Don't blind recursive init** — `git submodule update --init "
"--recursive` will fail on private modules"
msgstr "**不要盲目递归初始化** — `git submodule update --init --recursive` 会在私有模块上失败"

